{'symbol': 'AXON', 'date': '2021-09-22 07:30:00', 'title': 'PUEBLA MUNICIPAL POLICE PARTNERS WITH AXON FOR LARGEST TASER DEVICE DEPLOYMENT IN MEXICO', 'text': 'SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ., SEPT. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AXON (NASDAQ: AXON), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CONNECTED PUBLIC SAFETY TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT PUEBLA MUNICIPAL POLICE DEPARTMENT WILL EQUIP OFFICERS WITH TASER CONDUCTED ELECTRICAL DEVICES (CEDS) AS A CRITICAL DE-ESCALATION TOOL TO SAFELY HANDLE SITUATIONS AND REDUCE INJURIES TO OFFICERS AND THE PUBLIC.'}